      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 81,
      "offsetInSection": 9084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100540069006E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Parece que han acortado distancias.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 82,
      "offsetInSection": 9096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006100720065006300650020007100750065002000680061006E002000610063006F0072007400610064006F002000640069007300740061006E0063006900610073002E00100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sí. Soy nueva en la ciudad y todavía me estoy\nacostumbrando a todo... Espero poder contar<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ncon vuestra ayuda.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 83,
      "offsetInSection": 9176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 116
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y a ti no sé cómo darte las gracias por todo lo que\nhas hecho...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 84,
      "offsetInSection": 9408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059002000610020007400690020006E006F0020007300E90020006300F3006D006F0020006400610072007400650020006C006100730020006700720061006300690061007300200070006F007200200074006F0064006F0020006C006F0020007100750065000A00680061007300200068006500630068006F002E002E002E00100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡No, Tinkatuff! ¡Metal, no! ¡Suéltalo!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 85,
      "offsetInSection": 9548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004E006F002C002000540069006E006B006100740075006600660021002000A1004D006500740061006C002C0020006E006F0021002000A10053007500E9006C00740061006C006F002100100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bien está lo que bien acaba, supongo.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 86,
      "offsetInSection": 9636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200690065006E002000650073007400E10020006C006F00200071007500650020006200690065006E002000610063006100620061002C0020007300750070006F006E0067006F002E00100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sciii...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 87,
      "offsetInSection": 9720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530063006900690069002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Tin!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 88,
      "offsetInSection": 9740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100540069006E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿Y",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 89,
      "offsetInSection": 9752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00590000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mirabel y yo tenemos unas conversaciones de lo\nmás interesantes, y nuestros Pokémon también<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nparecen llevarse bien... de momento.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 90,
      "offsetInSection": 9764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 136
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sciii...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 91,
      "offsetInSection": 10036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530063006900690069002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Torvo me está enseñando un montón de cosas\nde la ciudad. Y mi Tinkatuff le ha cogido mucho<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ncariño a su Scizor.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 92,
      "offsetInSection": 10056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 118
    },
    {
